<title>USA: Pennzoil unit names GSD&amp;M as ad agency.</title>
<headline>Pennzoil unit names GSD&amp;M as ad agency.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennzoil Co unit Pennzoil Products Co said on Wednesday it named GSD&amp;M the company's advertising agency.</p>
<p>The Austin, Texas-based agency's other clients included Southwest Airlines Co, Wal-Mart Stores Inc, MasterCard and the state of Texas, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Pennzoil said its internal advertising department would work with GSD&amp;M and the company's brand managers.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
